sequenceDiagram
  participant BUS as Event Bus
  participant NOT as Notification Service
  participant MAIL as Servidor de Correo
  participant LOG as Logging Service

  BUS->>NOT: BatchFullyApproved(batchId, beneficiarios[])
  loop por cada beneficiario
    NOT->>NOT: construir plantilla de correo
    NOT->>MAIL: enviar correo (SMTP / SES)
    MAIL-->>NOT: ACK envío
    NOT->>NOT: guardar NotificationLog(status=SENT)
  end
  NOT->>LOG: log resumen de notificaciones enviadas
